python/mypy#22343 :: Segfault on type alias that refers to itself through another generic alias (type X = Meta[ | OPEN  | closed - | labels: crash | author Choco-princess | comments 1 | last: [hamarshehmhmd 2026-11-02] The loop is in `TypeType.make_normalized`. Expanding `Meta[X]` substitutes `T := X` and rebuilds `type[X]` via `make_normalized`. That calls `get_proper_type(X)` to check for a union, which expands `X` → `Meta[X]` → `type[X]` → `make_normalized` → ... forever.
